{"excerpt_id":"ex_876b66b88858_004","source_id":"src_876b66b88858","source_hash":"fed5b8707cca46fefe5a373cd0f705eb1a997d7e6b875fef7ffd2c2b8960a18d","text":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","location_hint":"paragraph 28","char_start":530,"char_end":574,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T21:27:41.264Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_876b66b88858_005","source_id":"src_876b66b88858","source_hash":"fed5b8707cca46fefe5a373cd0f705eb1a997d7e6b875fef7ffd2c2b8960a18d","text":"The JSON Schema Draft 2020-12 is a comprehensive update to the previous draft 2019-09 , addressing feedback and implementation experiences. This draft introduces features to simplify creating and validating JSON schemas.","location_hint":"paragraph 30","char_start":590,"char_end":810,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T21:27:41.264Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_876b66b88858_006","source_id":"src_876b66b88858","source_hash":"fed5b8707cca46fefe5a373cd0f705eb1a997d7e6b875fef7ffd2c2b8960a18d","text":"Here&#x27;s an overview of updates to Draft 2020-12;","location_hint":"paragraph 31","char_start":812,"char_end":864,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T21:27:41.264Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_876b66b88858_007","source_id":"src_876b66b88858","source_hash":"fed5b8707cca46fefe5a373cd0f705eb1a997d7e6b875fef7ffd2c2b8960a18d","text":"Redesigned Array and Tuple Keywords : The items and additionalItems keywords have been replaced by prefixItems and items .","location_hint":"paragraph 32","char_start":868,"char_end":990,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T21:27:41.264Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_876b66b88858_008","source_id":"src_876b66b88858","source_hash":"fed5b8707cca46fefe5a373cd0f705eb1a997d7e6b875fef7ffd2c2b8960a18d","text":"Dynamic References : The introduction of $dynamicRef and $dynamicAnchor replaces the older $recursiveRef and $recursiveAnchor .","location_hint":"paragraph 33","char_start":992,"char_end":1119,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T21:27:41.264Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_876b66b88858_009","source_id":"src_876b66b88858","source_hash":"fed5b8707cca46fefe5a373cd0f705eb1a997d7e6b875fef7ffd2c2b8960a18d","text":"Contains and UnevaluatedItems : Specifies how the contains keyword affects the unevaluatedItems keyword.","location_hint":"paragraph 34","char_start":1121,"char_end":1225,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T21:27:41.264Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_876b66b88858_010","source_id":"src_876b66b88858","source_hash":"fed5b8707cca46fefe5a373cd0f705eb1a997d7e6b875fef7ffd2c2b8960a18d","text":"Regular Expressions : Now expected to support Unicode characters, addressing inconsistencies in previous drafts.","location_hint":"paragraph 35","char_start":1227,"char_end":1339,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T21:27:41.264Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_876b66b88858_011","source_id":"src_876b66b88858","source_hash":"fed5b8707cca46fefe5a373cd0f705eb1a997d7e6b875fef7ffd2c2b8960a18d","text":"Media Type Changes : Drops the schema media type parameter.","location_hint":"paragraph 36","char_start":1341,"char_end":1400,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T21:27:41.264Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_876b66b88858_012","source_id":"src_876b66b88858","source_hash":"fed5b8707cca46fefe5a373cd0f705eb1a997d7e6b875fef7ffd2c2b8960a18d","text":"Embedded Schemas and Bundling : Provides guidance on bundling schemas into a Compound Schema Document.","location_hint":"paragraph 37","char_start":1402,"char_end":1504,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T21:27:41.264Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_876b66b88858_013","source_id":"src_876b66b88858","source_hash":"fed5b8707cca46fefe5a373cd0f705eb1a997d7e6b875fef7ffd2c2b8960a18d","text":"Vocabulary Changes : Separates the format vocabulary into format-annotation and format-assertion .","location_hint":"paragraph 38","char_start":1506,"char_end":1604,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-07T21:27:41.264Z"}
